{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2008-common-biology-19","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2008,"subject":"biology","number":19,"points":null,"unitId":"ecology","unitLabel":"진화·생태·행동","topic":"생태계·천이·천이","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["ecology"],"stem":"그림은빙퇴석지역이형성된후일어나는천이와그진행단계에\n따른토양표층의질소량변화를나타낸것이다.\n이천이단계에대한설명으로옳은것을<보기>에서모두고른\n것은?\n<보\n기>\nᄀ. 단계I에서는지의류, 균류, 박테리아가서식한다.\nᄂ. 단계II에서는오리나무가정착함으로써전나무숲형성이\n억제된다.\nᄃ. 단계III에서산불이일어나생태계가교란되면일차천이가\n다시시작된다.\nㄹ. 단계IV에서는식물생물량이증가하여유기물층의질소량이\n감소한다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t014"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t015"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t016"]},{"number":4,"text":"","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":[]},{"number":5,"text":"","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":[]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":674,"height":572,"region":0,"bbox":[29.555,51.921,269.6,228.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2008-common-biology-19/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":780,"height":362,"region":0,"bbox":[13.955,343.521,312.0,144.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2008-common-biology-19/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":9,"sourceRect":[429.645,551.679,758.256,1073.266],"width":328.611,"height":521.587,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[29.555,51.921,269.6,228.8],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[13.955,343.521,312.0,144.8],"section":"stem"},{"id":"t001","type":"text","text":"19. 그림은빙퇴석지역이형성된후일어나는천이와그진행단계에","bbox":[5.0,5.0,318.54,11.995],"spans":[{"text":"19.","bbox":[5.0,5.0,16.282,11.995],"origin":[5.0,14.596],"size":11.687,"flags":0,"font":"T